message: "If you use this software or its teaching materials, please cite it as below."
title: "学生成长全景评价平台 / Student Evaluation Dashboard Lab: a teaching demo of knowledge tracing, cognitive diagnosis, adaptive testing and privacy-aware dashboards on synthetic data"
abstract: "A static, offline-capable web dashboard for a fictional school built entirely on synthetic data. It shows knowledge tracing (BKT, PFA, a small DKT-style RNN), DINA cognitive diagnosis, 2PL IRT calibration with a computerized adaptive test, role-based reports with different levels of detail, a methods wall with verified references, and a compliance page with verified statutory texts. Privacy protection is a design goal. Part of the AI Teaching Demos series."
type: software
